# {{lb|en|ditransitive}} To [[estimate]] or [[predict]] (a duration or probability) for (something).
#: {{ux|en|I '''give''' it ten minutes before he gives up.}}
#: {{ux|en|I '''give''' it a 95% chance of success.}}
#: {{ux|en|I'll '''give''' their marriage six months.}}
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To [[yield]] or [[collapse]] under pressure or force.
